# Unlocking a Room's door is a special action, not an activated ability (CR 116.2m, 709.5e), so mana spendable "only to
# activate abilities" can't pay for it (CR 106.6). Turn 3, with Omen Hawker's {C}{U} in the pool and four other mana
# (two Swamps, Mox Jet, Mox Sapphire), Ritual Chamber's {3}{B}{B} can't be paid and the unlock is not offered; once Mox
# Pearl makes a fifth, it is, and the Hawker's mana is still in the pool after.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Omen Hawker
Mox Pearl
Swamp
Swamp x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Omen Hawker.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber.Cast(Ability: Unholy Annex)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Omen Hawker.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U} (Abilities) {C} (Abilities)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Unholy Annex.Activate(Ability: right door; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Unholy Annex.Activate(Ability: right door)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

